{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>憑神曲《idol》爆紅的日本超人氣組合YOASOBI，相隔兩年重臨香港，落實於明年1月21及22日，一連兩日假亞洲博覽館Areaa開騷。</p><p>此外，組合表示鑑於現時世界情勢，經慎重協議後，部分原定演出的國家、地區或場地將會取消。而組合自上月底自大阪展開的巡唱《YOASOBI ASIA 10-CITY DOME &amp; STADIUM TOUR 2026-2027 \"超惑星\"》，將改名《YOASOBI 11-CITY ASIA-OCEANIA TOUR 2026-2027 \"超惑星\"》，並於明年3月加開澳洲站，在墨爾本及悉尼開騷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.420503+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":271,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T03:28:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:08.969385+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:40.133116+00:00","content_hash":"20d877f94c0690c1b88e0db44bda31cc337e8361e476b38493f90e7137094745","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.420503+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}